ter ending Sep (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"},{"date":"2026-12-16","type":"entitlement","what":"股东大会登记日","what_en":"AGM record of depositors","ann":"11694137","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11694137","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-23","type":"agm","what":"第43届常年股东大会","what_en":"43rd Annual General Meeting","ann":"11694137","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11694137","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"On 16 November 2026, Exsim Hospitality announced that its wholly-owned subsidiary Blossom Hectares entered into a conditional call option agreement with related party Iconic Insight to acquire 32 floors of strata space of a 4-star hotel in Empire City, Damansara for RM226 million. Concurrently, the company proposed a RM125.4 million private placement for working capital and a dividend reinvestment plan. The company also continues to issue new shares from warrant exercises.","notable_en":["Wholly-owned subsidiary entered into a conditional call option agreement to acquire 32 floors of strata space of a 4-star hotel in Empire City from a related party for RM226 million.","Proposed a RM125.4 million private placement for working capital in Malaysia.","Proposed a dividend reinvestment plan."],"risks_en":["Proposed RM125.4 million private placement may dilute existing shareholders.","The proposed hotel acquisition is from a related party, constituting a related party transaction.","Ongoing warrant exercises gradually enlarge the share base."],"earnings_en":"For the financial year ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM101.062 million and net income was RM12.559 million, with a net margin of 12.4%. Revenue grew 35.9% QoQ and net income rose 8.4% QoQ; revenue increased 46.3% YoY and net income increased 13.5% YoY."}